WEBVTT

00:00:00.213 --> 00:00:05.043
<b>Wholesale price</b>: buy many, pay less for each one

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:10.573
Open the product in Inventario (inventory)

00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:15.143
Turn on the wholesale price

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.570
Type from how many pieces it applies, and the price for each

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:22.147
Save, and the rule is set

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:27.990
At the register you don't have to remember anything

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:35.829
At <b>25</b>, all of them switch to <b>$2.50</b> on their own
